true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_01316b66e1941f3b016a9c443d1f4487d0ba9feda682a5deaa","seq":10492,"timestamp":"1788626024Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"a4b4e6f4-8ab1-40bb-9a88-ff8aa798e2cc","content":"开始实现 Host outbound data path。为避免把 HCP/Noise 状态塞进 CLI，connector 位于 `ji-host-web`（Host transport application），复用 `ji-relay-protocol`；CLI 只负责从外部配置装配。Relay 在一次性 attach 后返回不含 token 的 heartbeat ACK，Host 仅在收到 ACK 后丢弃首次 token并进入 presence heartbeat/reconnect。","startedSeq":10407,"endedSeq":10492,"startedAt":"1788626024Z","endedAt":"1788626027Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":8581,"revision":10492,"observedAt":"1788626027Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788619517Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788626027Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":2071,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788619517,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788626027,"revision":10492,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_01316b66e1941f3b016a9c443d1f4487d0ba9feda682a5deaa","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-10493","seq":10493,"timestamp":"1788626027Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":10493,"endedSeq":10525,"startedAt":"1788626027Z","endedAt":"1788626230Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":10493,"activityEndSeq":10525,"totalEventCount":5,"toolCallCount":4,"thoughtCount":1,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":1,"writtenFileCount":2,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_04329dd8c7e5e017016a9c45238de487d090ee8249fcf37432","seq":10630,"timestamp":"1788626230Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"a4b4e6f4-8ab1-40bb-9a88-ff8aa798e2cc","content":"Host connector 的 per-route 状态机固定为 `WAIT_MESSAGE_1 → WAIT_MESSAGE_3 → HCP_AUTH → HCP_READY → CLOSED`。每条 route 独立 Noise counter/handshake/HCP connection identity；共享 Host socket 只承载 envelope multiplex。未知设备、缺少 X25519 key、route identity 变化、握手乱序、AEAD 失败、HCP auth 失败均只关闭对应 route并 fail closed，不把 plaintext 或异常详情发给 Relay。","startedSeq":10526,"endedSeq":10630,"startedAt":"1788626230Z","endedAt":"1788626231Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":8785,"revision":10630,"observedAt":"1788626231Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788619517Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788626231Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":2071,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788619517,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788626231,"revision":10630,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_04329dd8c7e5e017016a9c45238de487d090ee8249fcf37432","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-10631","seq":10631,"timestamp":"1788626231Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":10631,"endedSeq":10674,"startedAt":"1788626231Z","endedAt":"1788626316Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":10631,"activityEndSeq":10674,"totalEventCount":6,"toolCallCount":4,"thoughtCount":2,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":1,"writtenFileCount":2,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_06b9b8f7b846ff7e016a9c456f6f1c87d093c24eeb146a9056","seq":10758,"timestamp":"1788626316Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"a4b4e6f4-8ab1-40bb-9a88-ff8aa798e2cc","content":"Relay shared socket上的 `connection_id` 实际是每条 client route 的端到端 identity，不能固定为 Host presence connection；因此 Host peer 只固定 tenant/host/direction，Client peer固定 tenant/host/route/device/connection。这样完整 envelope 透明转发且每 route HCP/Noise identity不被改写。现在写 connector 与本地 fake Relay 集成测试。","startedSeq":10675,"endedSeq":10758,"startedAt":"1788626316Z","endedAt":"1788626317Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":8871,"revision":10758,"observedAt":"1788626317Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788619517Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788626317Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":2071,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788619517,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788626317,"revision":10758,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_06b9b8f7b846ff7e016a9c456f6f1c87d093c24eeb146a9056","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-10759","seq":10759,"timestamp":"1788626318Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":10759,"endedSeq":10801,"startedAt":"1788626318Z","endedAt":"1788626476Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":10759,"activityEndSeq":10801,"totalEventCount":6,"toolCallCount":4,"thoughtCount":2,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":0,"writtenFileCount":2,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_075c197c3f372df4016a9c4610af6887d0a119c2dd33601929","seq":10935,"timestamp":"1788626476Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"a4b4e6f4-8ab1-40bb-9a88-ff8aa798e2cc","content":"Connector 首次编译通过，但配置接口需先收紧两个部署差异，避免只在本地端口布局可用：\n\n- 公网入口 HTTPS 与 WSS 同端口；本地测试 Relay management 与 WS 是相邻端口。不能从 WSS 端口猜 management URL。\n- connector 不能直接依赖/导出 Host 私钥 bytes；改为最小 `HostIdentity` capability（返回公钥、签名 challenge、创建 responder Noise handshake），具体文件存储仍在 CLI 产品层。\n\n这两个修正后再接 composition，避免形成端口和密钥所有权旁路。","startedSeq":10802,"endedSeq":10935,"startedAt":"1788626476Z","endedAt":"1788626478Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":9032,"revision":10935,"observedAt":"1788626478Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788619517Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788626478Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":2071,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788619517,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788626478,"revision":10935,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStart